WEBVTT

00:03:58.234 --> 00:04:01.320
where the invisible stuff is
and what it's doing,

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:04.615
which will help us determine
what exactly it is.

00:04:06.784 --> 00:04:09.161
So when it comes to the cosmic accounting,

00:04:09.203 --> 00:04:11.163
here is what we know so far.

00:04:12.873 --> 00:04:15.710
We're in the midst
of a great cosmic drama,

00:04:15.710 --> 00:04:19.380
where space-time is curved
and it’s expanding.

00:04:19.672 --> 00:04:22.800
And the history and future
of that curvature and expansion

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:25.136
is determined by what's inside,

00:04:25.136 --> 00:04:27.763
which is mostly
not visible stuff like us --

00:04:27.763 --> 00:04:29.849
that's only about five percent.